      "text": "Fox Sports announced Game 1 of the Brewers-Rays World Series, between two small-market clubs, drew 12.26 million viewers. It drew higher ratings than four of the last six Game 1s, according to its PR team. Dodgers-Yankees Game 1 in 2024 drew 15.2 million viewers.",
